# Recommending next steps

When the user asks what to do next in an **ongoing session**, run the
`recommending-next-steps` skill. Reconstruct from git + asks, run
`deep-dive` or `debugging-an-issue` on the leftover, emit the
`_shared/next-prompt.md` fence. Do not implement.

`/next-steps` and `/recommending-next-steps` are this rule. A `## Next`
sentence without the fenced `text` block is incomplete.

Full procedure: read the `recommending-next-steps` skill.
